sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant W as Workflow UI
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant T as Triggers
  participant F as Finance UI
  U->>W: Check-in patient
  W->>DB: INSERT appointments, patient_checkins
  U->>W: Complete treatment
  W->>DB: INSERT treatment_plans
  U->>W: Generate bill ₹1000
  W->>DB: INSERT billings, billing_items
  T-->>DB: sync_referral_from_billing
  U->>W: Take payment ₹1000
  W->>DB: INSERT billing_payments
  T-->>DB: set_billing_payment_dedupe_key
  W->>DB: UPDATE billings.amount_paid, payment_status
  F->>DB: SELECT billing_payments WHERE payment_date in period
  DB-->>F: Collected ↑ ₹1000
  Note over F,DB: FY actuals drift until recompute_fy_actuals RPC
